{"aixsuture":{"rubrics":{"original":[{"name":"Respect for tissue","levels":["Often used unnecessary force on tissue or caused damage by inappropriate use of instruments","Carefully handling of tissue but occasionally caused inadvertent damage","Consistently handled tissues appropriately with minimal damage"]},{"name":"Time and motion","levels":["Many unnecessary moves","Efficient time and motion, but some unnecessary moves","Economy of movement and maximum efficiency"]},{"name":"Instrument handling","levels":["Repeatedly makes tentative or awkward moves with instruments","Competent use of instruments, although occasionally appeared stiff or awkward","Fluid moves with instruments and no awkwardness"]},{"name":"Suture technique","levels":["Clumsy and insecure, inadequately tying knots and inability to maintain tension","Careful and slow with most knots placed properly with proper tension","Excellent control of the suture, with proper placement of knots and correct tension"]},{"name":"Flow of operation and forward planning","levels":["Frequently stopped operation or needed to discuss next move","Demonstrated ability for forward planning with steady progression of operative procedure","Obviously planned course of operation with effortless flow from one move to the next"]},{"name":"Knowledge of specific procedure","levels":["Deficient knowledge. Needed specific instruction at most operative steps","Knew all important aspect of the operation","Demonstrated familiarity with all aspects of the operation"]},{"name":"Quality of final product","levels":["Very poor","Competent","Exceptional"]},{"name":"Overall performance","levels":["Very poor","Competent","Exceptional"]}],"reworded":[{"name":"Gentleness with tissue","levels":["Frequently applied excessive force or injured the tissue through improper instrument use","Handled the tissue with care, though sometimes damaged it by accident","Always treated the tissue properly, causing hardly any damage"]},{"name":"Economy of motion","levels":["Lots of wasted movements","Mostly efficient, with a few wasted movements","Every movement purposeful and highly efficient"]},{"name":"Use of instruments","levels":["Moves the instruments hesitantly or clumsily again and again","Uses the instruments competently, with occasional stiff or clumsy moments","Smooth, confident instrument movements without any clumsiness"]},{"name":"Suturing and knot tying","levels":["Clumsy and unsure; knots are poorly tied and tension is not kept","Careful but slow; most knots are placed correctly with appropriate tension","Excellent suture control; knots are well placed and correctly tensioned"]},{"name":"Procedural flow and planning ahead","levels":["Often paused or had to talk through the next step","Planned ahead and kept the procedure moving steadily","Clearly planned the whole procedure, moving effortlessly from one step to the next"]},{"name":"Familiarity with the procedure","levels":["Lacked knowledge and needed instruction at most steps","Knew all the key parts of the procedure","Clearly familiar with every aspect of the procedure"]},{"name":"Result of the repair","levels":["Unacceptable","Adequate","Outstanding"]},{"name":"Overall skill","levels":["Unacceptable","Adequate","Outstanding"]}]},"videos":[{"id":"V11G","grs":10.333333333333332,"label":"novice","ratings":[[1,1,1,1,1,1,1,1],[4,1,2,2,1,1,1,2],[2,1,1,1,1,1,1,1]],"item_mean":[2.3333333333333335,1.0,1.3333333333333333,1.3333333333333333,1.0,1.0,1.0,1.3333333333333333],"frames":["frames/aix_V11G_0.jpg","frames/aix_V11G_1.jpg","frames/aix_V11G_2.jpg","frames/aix_V11G_3.jpg","frames/aix_V11G_4.jpg","frames/aix_V11G_5.jpg","frames/aix_V11G_6.jpg","frames/aix_V11G_7.jpg"],"wordings":{"original":{"items":[{"score":1.511,"levels":[[0.0,0.0],[0.4968,0.8809],[1.0,0.0]],"pred":[0.1424,0.2162],"read":[0.1269,0.2249],"target":[0.3323,0.2936],"pred_off":0.0476},{"score":1.134,"levels":[[0.0,0.0],[0.5123,0.8848],[1.0,-0.0]],"pred":[0.0177,0.0691],"read":[0.0344,0.0594],"targ